WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world, we hold balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Split primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:43.920 --> 01:44.900
Darn it.

01:45.310 --> 01:47.100
Were it not that I cannot show my face,

01:47.640 --> 01:49.660
how could you guys match me?

01:51.430 --> 01:52.020
Who's there?

01:55.560 --> 01:56.540
Fairy Yunxiao.

02:03.200 --> 02:03.980
Father.

02:04.280 --> 02:05.490
An assassin was found in Dragon Palace.

02:05.510 --> 02:06.900
Someone really sneaked in here.

02:07.000 --> 02:08.890
The assassin failed
to hurt Little Prince.

02:08.910 --> 02:10.820
Many guards saw him.

02:10.840 --> 02:11.820
This matter can't be fake.

02:11.840 --> 02:13.820
Since Junior Ling'e spoke the truth,

02:13.870 --> 02:15.780
then she didn't
break the glazed lantern.

02:15.800 --> 02:17.610
Please have mercy.

02:22.910 --> 02:24.290
We caught her just this morning.

02:24.310 --> 02:26.260
And an assassin appears out of nowhere?

02:26.310 --> 02:27.340
What a coincidence.

02:27.520 --> 02:28.290
So coincidental.

02:28.710 --> 02:29.500
So coincidental.

02:31.030 --> 02:33.850
Tomorrow, my son weds.

02:33.870 --> 02:34.660
Turtle Minister.

02:35.000 --> 02:37.220
Order tighter security.

02:37.240 --> 02:39.500
Tomorrow, we can't let the assassin

02:39.520 --> 02:40.610
ruin my son's wedding.

02:41.120 --> 02:41.610
Yes.

02:42.680 --> 02:43.290
Father.

02:43.470 --> 02:45.690
Then, about Ling'e...

02:49.800 --> 02:51.100
I'm naturally willing to let her go.

02:51.400 --> 02:52.610
The question is whether she wants

02:52.630 --> 02:54.130
to leave on her own.

02:54.240 --> 02:55.690
What does that mean?

02:59.680 --> 03:00.450
Ling'e.

03:01.280 --> 03:02.130
Are you all right?

03:04.910 --> 03:05.690
I'm fine.

03:06.630 --> 03:07.540
Junior Ling'e.

03:07.590 --> 03:08.850
The culprit you chased last night

03:08.870 --> 03:09.610
has been found.

03:09.630 --> 03:10.780
Your suspicion is cleared.

03:11.150 --> 03:11.850
Come home with us.

03:12.120 --> 03:13.500
Yeah, come back with us.

03:15.310 --> 03:16.100
Young lady.

03:17.840 --> 03:19.850
Do you wish to know who your father is?

03:20.520 --> 03:21.890
I never thought

03:22.310 --> 03:24.060
I still had family in this world.

03:25.240 --> 03:27.220
Please, tell me who my father is.

03:27.240 --> 03:28.660
Even if his identity

03:28.680 --> 03:30.450
brings you great pain?

03:30.520 --> 03:32.540
No matter what, he's still my father.

03:32.710 --> 03:34.500
Even if I could just see him once.

03:34.800 --> 03:36.850
I just wanna see what he looks like.

03:36.870 --> 03:37.380
Your Majesty.

03:38.520 --> 03:39.820
Someone from the Ascendance Sect
seeks an audience.

03:40.560 --> 03:41.340
Good.

03:41.590 --> 03:43.380
If you want to know who your father is,

03:43.400 --> 03:44.850
stay in prison today.

03:44.870 --> 03:46.500
Don't go back to your Senior.

03:46.520 --> 03:47.820
Tomorrow during the wedding,

03:47.840 --> 03:49.660
I'll tell you everything.

03:49.680 --> 03:50.410
Why?

03:50.590 --> 03:51.340
The people of Ascendance Sect

03:51.360 --> 03:53.170
probably already know your identity.

03:53.190 --> 03:54.610
Their care for you over the years

03:54.630 --> 03:56.100
was all an illusion.

03:59.870 --> 04:01.450
Was that mysterious person caught?

04:01.470 --> 04:04.260
Identity unknown. Whereabouts unclear.

04:04.800 --> 04:05.610
Meaning,

04:05.630 --> 04:07.130
my suspicion isn't fully cleared yet.

04:07.470 --> 04:10.100
Dragon Palace can't let me walk free.

04:12.840 --> 04:14.380
Once things are clear after the wedding,

04:14.710 --> 04:16.050
come pick me up then.

04:17.000 --> 04:17.780
Junior.

04:21.270 --> 04:22.140
Are you alright?

04:24.630 --> 04:25.410
I'm fine.

04:25.720 --> 04:27.810
The Dragon King treats me well.

04:27.830 --> 04:29.050
Senior, you needn't worry.

04:29.720 --> 04:30.490
Good.

04:30.630 --> 04:31.410
Off you go then.

04:35.070 --> 04:36.610
Tomorrow is my son's wedding.

04:36.920 --> 04:39.220
Enjoy the feast and have fun.

04:46.460 --> 04:49.300
[Episode 25]

04:53.390 --> 04:55.050
This outfit is stunning.

04:55.070 --> 04:55.580
Indeed.

04:55.830 --> 04:56.810
On this joyous day,

04:56.830 --> 04:58.810
he must look his finest.

04:58.870 --> 05:00.290
Let's check everything once more.

05:00.310 --> 05:01.290
We can't afford any mistakes.

05:01.310 --> 05:01.850
Okay.

05:07.480 --> 05:09.170
East Sea is so great.

05:09.190 --> 05:10.700
We love the East Sea.

05:11.720 --> 05:13.220
Working is so happy.

05:13.240 --> 05:14.340
- So happy.
- Yes.

05:19.630 --> 05:20.730
The Sea Deity Sect rules.

05:22.040 --> 05:23.140
The Sea Deity Sect rules.

05:23.240 --> 05:24.490
Right, we're all its followers.

05:38.630 --> 05:40.930
When can I get married?

05:42.180 --> 05:44.420
[Happiness]

05:46.630 --> 05:47.580
Put this over there.

05:55.430 --> 05:56.700
In a bit, let's run through it again.

05:59.540 --> 06:02.340
[Happiness]

06:19.310 --> 06:22.290
Since last night, Bian Zhuang vanished.

06:22.310 --> 06:23.460
Aren't you going to find him?

06:24.240 --> 06:26.220
Lord Bian has his mission.

06:27.600 --> 06:29.250
Why bother worrying?

06:31.510 --> 06:33.290
After Ao Yi's wedding today,

06:33.830 --> 06:36.700
your decades of plans in East Sea

06:37.120 --> 06:38.660
will go down the drain.

06:39.120 --> 06:40.410
Does that not concern you?

06:41.310 --> 06:42.700
How do you know

06:44.070 --> 06:46.290
no surprise will happen today?

06:51.270 --> 06:52.900
What plan do you have

06:53.430 --> 06:54.900
to be so calm?

06:56.430 --> 06:57.370
Today

06:58.310 --> 07:00.140
is a big day.

07:22.100 --> 07:24.780
[Happiness]

07:40.270 --> 07:41.580
Keep the music playing.

07:41.600 --> 07:42.410
Don't let the mood drop.

07:46.430 --> 07:47.220
Aunt.

07:49.040 --> 07:50.900
Didn't you quit drinking?

07:51.270 --> 07:53.100
Just sniffing it. What's up?

07:54.120 --> 07:54.900
Look.

07:57.120 --> 08:00.100
What is Changshou planning to do?

08:00.120 --> 08:02.660
Senior always plays it safe.
He has his plans.

08:02.680 --> 08:04.020
Then why ask me?

08:05.000 --> 08:06.340
Where's Fairy Yunxiao?

08:07.950 --> 08:08.730
Changshou.

08:09.600 --> 08:10.370
Changshou.

08:11.310 --> 08:12.900
The Dragon King's too much.

08:13.600 --> 08:15.460
He's late for his son's wedding.

08:16.240 --> 08:17.020
Yes.

08:17.510 --> 08:18.490
Probably

08:18.720 --> 08:19.900
stuck in traffic?

08:21.830 --> 08:23.340
Stuck in traffic underwater?

08:23.920 --> 08:24.900
Nonsense.

08:25.560 --> 08:26.370
Yeah.

08:43.120 --> 08:43.890
Your Majesty.

08:44.870 --> 08:45.980
You sent for me?

08:48.910 --> 08:50.250
Why are you standing?

08:50.270 --> 08:51.220
Come, sit.

08:51.390 --> 08:52.060
No.

08:52.440 --> 08:53.220
Sit.

08:56.320 --> 08:58.100
Then I shall be so bold.

09:03.910 --> 09:04.700
Turtle.

09:07.030 --> 09:09.530
How many years have you served me?

09:10.630 --> 09:11.420
Well...

09:12.960 --> 09:14.370
A thousand years.

09:15.080 --> 09:16.300
A thousand years?

09:18.030 --> 09:19.060
Yes.

09:19.120 --> 09:21.300
I recall you were a little turtle then.

09:21.320 --> 09:21.890
Yes.

09:22.510 --> 09:24.300
So cute back then.

09:28.320 --> 09:30.100
It has not been easy.

09:31.320 --> 09:32.490
In another thousand years,

09:32.910 --> 09:35.530
I still wish to serve Your Majesty.

09:36.240 --> 09:38.100
For Your Majesty,

09:38.120 --> 09:39.580
and for the Dragon Palace
of the East Sea,

09:39.720 --> 09:41.700
dying would be no regret.

09:44.790 --> 09:46.490
I know your loyalty.

09:46.510 --> 09:47.130
Yes.

09:50.870 --> 09:51.700
Turtle.

09:53.200 --> 09:56.340
If one day I do something wrong,

09:57.270 --> 09:58.490
what would you think?

09:59.720 --> 10:00.490
Well...

10:01.510 --> 10:02.890
If I should ever do something

10:04.670 --> 10:07.490
that harms the Dragon Palace,

10:07.840 --> 10:09.700
would you still stand with me?

10:10.000 --> 10:12.100
How could Your Majesty do wrong?

10:12.120 --> 10:13.370
Whatever Your Majesty does

10:13.390 --> 10:15.300
must be far-sighted,

10:15.320 --> 10:17.610
mysterious, and proper.

10:17.630 --> 10:18.850
Enough, enough.

10:19.600 --> 10:21.490
No need to flatter me today.

10:24.120 --> 10:25.700
Go bring that girl here.

10:27.120 --> 10:27.890
Yes.

10:51.600 --> 10:52.370
Young lady.

10:52.440 --> 10:53.610
His Majesty summons you.

11:00.510 --> 11:02.610
Your Majesty, she is here.

11:03.870 --> 11:04.890
Greetings, Your Majesty.

11:06.200 --> 11:06.940
Young lady.

11:07.670 --> 11:08.700
Come with me.

11:09.150 --> 11:09.940
What?

11:10.790 --> 11:11.580
Go on.

11:17.670 --> 11:18.700
You will not be needed.

11:18.720 --> 11:19.820
Your Majesty, but...

11:19.840 --> 11:22.130
Rest easy. I know what I'm doing.

11:22.270 --> 11:24.730
The path ahead is not for you.

11:25.320 --> 11:26.940
Young lady, let's go.

11:40.670 --> 11:41.700
Aunt. Junior.

11:42.270 --> 11:43.100
Cover me.

11:48.630 --> 11:49.420
Your Majesty.

11:49.720 --> 11:51.100
Where are you taking me?

11:51.120 --> 11:54.100
To a place you once lived.

11:55.670 --> 11:57.460
But this isn't heading to guest rooms.

11:58.630 --> 11:59.650
Not a guest room.

12:00.200 --> 12:03.100
It's where you lived in as an infant.

12:15.000 --> 12:15.890
Where are we?

12:18.550 --> 12:19.980
Shh.

12:21.510 --> 12:22.420
Don't speak.

12:24.320 --> 12:26.890
Feel the spiritual power here.

12:39.910 --> 12:40.700
What is this?

12:41.320 --> 12:45.250
Your father's spiritual power
lingers here.

12:45.840 --> 12:47.370
It gathered in this very place.

12:47.790 --> 12:50.700
A thousand years, and it won't fade.

12:54.600 --> 12:55.370
My father?

12:56.240 --> 12:57.010
Yes.

12:57.790 --> 12:59.730
Don't you want to see him?

13:00.510 --> 13:02.250
I can take you to see him right now.

13:03.480 --> 13:04.850
You can take me to see him?

13:05.870 --> 13:06.850
I said before,

13:07.510 --> 13:10.490
the Chaos Bell can bend time itself.

13:11.240 --> 13:12.250
Just that

13:12.480 --> 13:14.300
your spiritual power is too weak now.

13:14.510 --> 13:16.420
Only able to trace back a moment.

13:16.440 --> 13:17.130
But,

13:17.910 --> 13:19.890
your father's spiritual energy is here.

13:20.320 --> 13:22.700
He's no ordinary mortal like us.

13:22.910 --> 13:26.130
As long as you comprehend carefully,

13:26.510 --> 13:28.980
you'll trace back a thousand years soon.

13:29.000 --> 13:30.010
At that time,

13:30.440 --> 13:32.700
you can meet your father.

13:33.200 --> 13:34.490
Tracing back a thousand years?

13:39.240 --> 13:40.610
If I go back that far,

13:41.670 --> 13:42.890
did Ascendance Sect exist?

13:43.000 --> 13:44.100
Ascendance Sect?

13:44.720 --> 13:46.890
There was no such sect back then.

13:46.910 --> 13:49.100
But my Senior, Mentor, and Aunt...

13:49.120 --> 13:51.420
They're hardly worth mentioning.

13:53.840 --> 13:56.100
Then all my days at Jade Division...

13:56.720 --> 13:57.490
Could it be...

14:04.510 --> 14:06.250
Do you know how long I saved it?

14:06.270 --> 14:07.460
Mentor, strong drink cuts deep.

14:07.480 --> 14:08.100
No more drinking.

14:14.510 --> 14:15.820
Mother, Brother.

14:16.320 --> 14:17.850
I have reached my new home.

14:20.840 --> 14:21.850
I have made up my mind.

14:24.480 --> 14:25.490
I am not going back.

14:26.120 --> 14:27.730
Did you not wish to see your father?

14:28.720 --> 14:30.220
Go back a thousand years,

14:30.440 --> 14:32.250
and he will be waiting there.

14:32.270 --> 14:33.890
But I already have a home.

14:35.120 --> 14:37.420
[Jade Division]
Though it's poor and shabby,

14:37.720 --> 14:38.890
that's my home.

14:40.120 --> 14:41.490
I also have family now.

14:42.510 --> 14:44.060
Pity that as their Mentor,

14:44.270 --> 14:45.730
I have no achievements.

14:45.790 --> 14:48.490
For these two kids,
if Tribulation befalls them,

14:48.510 --> 14:49.850
may I ask you

14:52.120 --> 14:53.130
to help them out?

14:54.200 --> 14:55.890
A rather weak Mentor

14:56.480 --> 14:58.250
and a very annoying Senior.

14:58.910 --> 15:00.300
Still, they are my family.

15:02.040 --> 15:06.720
♪An edge hides, yet flows with ease♪

15:07.400 --> 15:13.930
♪Making me lean down and confirm slowly♪

15:15.270 --> 15:16.890
Even if this home falls short,

15:18.510 --> 15:20.220
I live very happily.

15:20.860 --> 15:23.870
♪Day after day, with whom to share♪

15:23.870 --> 15:24.730
I believe

15:25.840 --> 15:27.850
my parents, even a thousand years ago,

15:30.200 --> 15:31.700
would be happy

15:35.030 --> 15:36.490
to see me living happily today.

15:38.440 --> 15:39.220
Young lady.

15:40.670 --> 15:42.010
Your words

15:42.550 --> 15:45.220
put me in a tough spot.

15:47.200 --> 15:48.130
Thank you, Your Majesty.

15:49.080 --> 15:50.300
I should leave now.

15:55.510 --> 15:56.300
You...

16:06.870 --> 16:08.940
Did you think

16:09.200 --> 16:10.580
I brought you to see your father?

16:11.320 --> 16:12.890
I'm making a wager

16:12.910 --> 16:14.100
with someone mysterious.

16:14.440 --> 16:16.250
If I win, all is well.

16:16.750 --> 16:18.370
If I lose,

16:19.670 --> 16:21.100
that Chaos Bell of yours

16:21.270 --> 16:23.460
is my only way out.

16:23.720 --> 16:24.730
So,

16:25.360 --> 16:26.610
you cannot go anywhere.

16:28.480 --> 16:29.490
Scripture of Steadiness says,

16:29.670 --> 16:31.460
"When things look bad, flee fast."

16:38.870 --> 16:39.460
You...

16:39.790 --> 16:40.580
Young lady.

16:40.870 --> 16:43.890
Do you know
of the ancient Deity-Demon War?

16:49.870 --> 16:52.730
Aren't you curious?

16:52.910 --> 16:54.820
Why did our Dragon Clan

16:55.200 --> 16:57.850
earn great merit in that war

16:57.870 --> 16:59.890
and get to share the realm with humans?

17:00.630 --> 17:01.530
Look.

17:02.200 --> 17:03.940
Do I look human to you?

17:05.310 --> 17:06.090
No.

17:06.480 --> 17:07.290
Then,

17:08.750 --> 17:09.940
do I look like a demon?

17:11.400 --> 17:12.180
A little bit.

17:12.200 --> 17:12.980
A little?

17:13.240 --> 17:14.490
No, not at all.

17:14.510 --> 17:15.180
Wrong.

17:15.440 --> 17:17.420
Far more than that.

17:18.480 --> 17:21.250
I am a demon.

17:22.000 --> 17:23.290
To the Human Clan,

17:23.510 --> 17:26.290
I am both savior and enemy.

17:26.720 --> 17:28.220
To the Dragon Clan,

17:28.240 --> 17:30.860
humans feel both gratitude and fear.

17:30.920 --> 17:34.010
They drove us beyond the Four Seas,

17:34.030 --> 17:35.220
far from the Mortal Realm.

17:35.240 --> 17:36.250
And they dressed it up,

17:36.270 --> 17:38.700
calling me King of the Four Seas.

17:38.790 --> 17:40.050
How absurd.

17:40.720 --> 17:42.860
The truth is, they had me

17:43.590 --> 17:45.290
guard that ancient demon for them.

17:45.310 --> 17:47.900
It's so terrifying that even
thinking about it scares me.

17:48.070 --> 17:49.810
It's been sealed
beneath the Eye of the Sea

17:49.830 --> 17:54.050
for a thousand years,
and it still won't stay quiet.

17:57.400 --> 17:59.140
What has that to do with me?

18:00.270 --> 18:01.810
Everything.

18:02.880 --> 18:04.460
Everything.

18:05.030 --> 18:05.810
Because...

18:07.920 --> 18:09.660
Transposition. Go.

18:10.640 --> 18:12.250
Because your father...

18:12.310 --> 18:12.730
He...

18:24.920 --> 18:26.420
Copy the scripture 500 times?

18:26.420 --> 18:28.100
[Copy the Scripture 500 Times]

18:34.640 --> 18:35.660
Senior.

18:38.310 --> 18:39.250
Why is it you?

18:39.270 --> 18:41.530
I sensed Your Majesty missed me.

18:42.510 --> 18:44.050
The Swap Talisman?

18:45.480 --> 18:46.250
Junior.

18:50.310 --> 18:51.620
No wonder you're the Dragon King.

18:51.640 --> 18:53.700
You even know human spells so well.

18:53.720 --> 18:54.460
Impressive.

18:54.920 --> 18:57.810
So you are the mastermind

18:57.830 --> 18:59.900
behind the succession battle.

19:00.310 --> 19:01.090
No, no.

19:01.110 --> 19:02.250
Can't call me a mastermind.

19:02.270 --> 19:02.730
I am merely

19:02.750 --> 19:04.940
a human disciple playing it safe.

19:05.400 --> 19:06.810
You're too arrogant.

19:06.830 --> 19:08.490
Since you fell into my hands,

19:08.680 --> 19:10.460
I definitely won't spare you today.

19:10.480 --> 19:11.250
Because

19:11.400 --> 19:12.940
you're too dangerous.

19:16.270 --> 19:17.290
Celestial Court weapons?

19:17.350 --> 19:17.980
Who's there?

19:18.610 --> 19:20.700
♪Now, a levee holds back the storm♪

19:21.010 --> 19:24.020
♪Fight against fate for my life♪

19:24.020 --> 19:26.840
♪Close eyes to sense the world♪

19:26.840 --> 19:29.260
♪Years splash ink♪

19:29.440 --> 19:30.900
Fairy Yunxiao?

19:33.200 --> 19:34.900
Your watch over Yunxiao

19:34.920 --> 19:36.460
truly never stops.

19:36.480 --> 19:39.010
It kept her from opening up to me,

19:39.240 --> 19:40.530
nearly causing a misunderstanding.

19:43.510 --> 19:44.290
Yunxiao.

19:44.790 --> 19:45.700
Who are you?

19:45.920 --> 19:46.900
Do I know you?

19:47.720 --> 19:49.940
A lowly human disciple like you,

19:50.070 --> 19:52.290
what brings you here so late at night?

19:52.310 --> 19:54.700
Fairy Yunxiao is naturally clever.

19:54.720 --> 19:55.570
She refusing to acknowledge me

19:55.590 --> 19:56.460
must have a reason.

19:56.480 --> 19:58.090
The clues aren't hard to read.

19:58.310 --> 20:00.140
She wants to hide from eyes and ears.

20:00.160 --> 20:01.980
If not for the Dragon Palace,

20:02.160 --> 20:03.730
I'd teach you a real lesson.

20:04.590 --> 20:06.220
Stop staring. Get out.

20:07.400 --> 20:08.460
Sorry to disturb you.

20:09.920 --> 20:10.940
You brat.

20:11.160 --> 20:13.090
You always rejected my help before.

20:13.310 --> 20:14.090
Today,

20:14.310 --> 20:16.200
I'll make sure you see my real skills.

20:17.520 --> 20:19.300
Yunxiao and I are in sync.

20:19.320 --> 20:20.260
From that moment on,

20:20.400 --> 20:22.660
no words were needed between us.

20:22.680 --> 20:24.050
Everything fell into place.

20:24.110 --> 20:26.500
Your Majesty took Junior Ling'e today.

20:26.520 --> 20:27.980
So you probably couldn't personally

20:28.000 --> 20:29.610
monitor Fairy Yunxiao's movements.

20:30.110 --> 20:31.140
I never thought

20:31.790 --> 20:33.530
one careless moment

20:33.550 --> 20:36.140
would lead to all this.

20:36.230 --> 20:37.210
Fairy Yunxiao,

20:37.840 --> 20:39.370
though you are a Quasi-Saint,

20:39.550 --> 20:40.980
and I may fall short of you,

20:41.160 --> 20:44.010
I'm still an Empyreal Aureate Immortal.

20:44.320 --> 20:46.100
If we really fight,

20:46.120 --> 20:48.050
even if I lose,

20:48.070 --> 20:51.420
you'd be badly drained too.

20:54.120 --> 20:55.020
Your Majesty,

20:55.350 --> 20:56.700
you never meant to strike.

20:56.720 --> 20:58.210
Why lose your temper now?

20:59.550 --> 21:00.700
How do you know?

21:04.670 --> 21:06.330
I don't wanna fight?

21:06.630 --> 21:08.890
A Quasi-Saint
against an Empyreal Aureate Immortal

21:08.910 --> 21:10.970
will take hours to settle.

21:11.120 --> 21:12.890
Besides, you set this trap

21:12.910 --> 21:15.100
to ruin the wedding.

21:15.120 --> 21:16.330
Now that the situation is set,

21:16.480 --> 21:18.570
why trouble yourself, Your Majesty?

21:21.120 --> 21:24.490
Looks like you already set the game

21:24.880 --> 21:27.020
to play with me.

21:29.480 --> 21:31.610
Fine. For many years,

21:31.630 --> 21:33.250
no one dared play against me.

21:33.320 --> 21:35.690
Today I'll play a game with you.

21:36.760 --> 21:38.380
When did you first find out

21:38.600 --> 21:40.100
I was the mastermind?

21:40.150 --> 21:42.660
I knew from the start.

21:43.040 --> 21:44.130
From the start?

21:45.760 --> 21:48.180
The Westdawn Sect used the Crown Prince,

21:48.200 --> 21:49.250
scheming for years.

21:50.240 --> 21:52.530
Yet the Crown Prince only held power,

21:52.550 --> 21:54.460
never claimed the throne.

21:55.880 --> 21:57.940
His wedding
with the Mermaid Princess failed too.

21:58.430 --> 22:01.220
Who kept blocking the Westdawn Sect?

22:02.710 --> 22:05.530
I'm just a senile old dragon.

22:05.760 --> 22:07.220
Aged and weak.

22:07.510 --> 22:08.860
How could I manage that?

22:08.880 --> 22:11.250
The weapons I used
were all Celestial Court treasures.

22:11.350 --> 22:13.220
Each is a demon-slaying artifact.

22:13.430 --> 22:15.820
Yet you blocked them all, unharmed.

22:16.240 --> 22:18.380
How can you say you're aged and weak?

22:18.400 --> 22:19.690
On this Dragon Palace trip,

22:19.710 --> 22:20.970
the biggest obstacle

22:21.040 --> 22:22.410
isn't the Westdawn Sect,

22:22.430 --> 22:23.690
but you, Your Majesty.

22:23.910 --> 22:25.890
Westdawn's fed
on the Dragon Palace for years.

22:25.910 --> 22:27.300
All with your consent.

22:27.510 --> 22:29.580
But why did you refuse to let them

22:29.600 --> 22:30.930
complete this final step?

22:31.110 --> 22:33.490
In my view, there is only one reason.

22:33.510 --> 22:35.090
You are waiting for the best offer.

22:36.320 --> 22:37.740
I'm a realistic dragon.

22:38.230 --> 22:40.490
Don't care about Celestial Court
or Three Sects.

22:40.510 --> 22:42.180
All I care about

22:42.320 --> 22:44.090
is who offers the most.

22:45.160 --> 22:46.890
So as long as the Dragon Palace
stays neutral,

22:47.040 --> 22:48.020
the Celestial Court and Westdawn

22:48.040 --> 22:49.610
will keep winning over the Dragon Clan.

22:50.110 --> 22:52.090
Your leverage will keep growing.

22:52.110 --> 22:53.490
Once pledging to one side,

22:53.790 --> 22:55.930
I'll lose the leverage to demand more

22:56.110 --> 22:58.580
and break completely with the other.

22:59.280 --> 23:00.610
The loss outweighs the gain.

23:01.440 --> 23:02.210
In the end,

23:02.510 --> 23:05.300
whether Ao Jia leads the dragons
to Westdawn,

23:05.320 --> 23:07.420
or Ao Yi to the Celestial Court,

23:07.440 --> 23:08.980
you will intervene.

23:09.070 --> 23:11.020
So from the very beginning, you knew

23:11.720 --> 23:12.770
your opponent

23:13.160 --> 23:13.980
was me.

23:14.480 --> 23:15.180
Your Majesty,

23:15.720 --> 23:16.860
this game is set.

23:16.880 --> 23:18.700
Black and white, evenly poised.

23:19.760 --> 23:20.300
Wrong.

23:20.670 --> 23:21.860
It's not equal.

23:22.280 --> 23:23.810
This is the East Sea.

23:24.070 --> 23:24.740
I have

23:25.390 --> 23:27.260
the first-move advantage.

23:28.510 --> 23:30.050
The advantage you spoke of,

23:32.720 --> 23:33.860
could it be Jin Chan?

23:35.110 --> 23:36.420
Your Majesty wants me

23:37.040 --> 23:38.980
to ruin the wedding in three days?

23:42.510 --> 23:45.180
Hear those magpies sing and cheer,

23:45.350 --> 23:47.810
our happy couple's finally here.

23:48.000 --> 23:50.140
Two are better than one,

23:50.160 --> 23:52.490
that's the way it goes.

23:52.510 --> 23:54.610
Now let's welcome our newlyweds.

23:55.200 --> 23:56.140
Music.

23:56.300 --> 24:01.540
[Happiness]

24:41.630 --> 24:44.690
I know you two can't wait.

24:44.880 --> 24:47.450
But all is ready,

24:47.680 --> 24:48.980
except your father.

24:49.510 --> 24:51.220
Let's see where the Dragon King is.

24:55.440 --> 24:56.780
What a perfect match.

24:56.880 --> 24:58.100
So adorable.

25:00.360 --> 25:02.010
That night in Lotus Hall,

25:02.800 --> 25:04.300
you wanted to see two people.

25:04.440 --> 25:05.130
One

25:05.470 --> 25:07.490
was Westdawn Sect's mole.

25:07.800 --> 25:09.010
You let him cause chaos

25:09.150 --> 25:10.690
to disrupt the Celestial Court's plan.

25:11.030 --> 25:11.900
Exactly.

25:12.560 --> 25:13.810
What about the other person?

25:13.950 --> 25:15.300
The other person

25:16.120 --> 25:17.220
would be me.

25:20.000 --> 25:21.610
The Celestial Court publicly presented

25:21.630 --> 25:23.610
the Pregenesis Sword fragment to you.

25:23.830 --> 25:24.930
Your Majesty saw through it.

25:24.950 --> 25:26.660
This was Celestial Court's baiting trap.

25:26.680 --> 25:28.130
If Westdawn dared to strike,

25:28.150 --> 25:30.100
the Celestial Court would
unleash fatal moves.

25:30.120 --> 25:31.300
After warning Westdawn,

25:31.440 --> 25:32.180
naturally you'd also warn me,

25:32.200 --> 25:34.300
the proxy sent by the Celestial Court.

25:34.360 --> 25:35.300
But you didn't

25:35.590 --> 25:37.490
show up that night.

25:38.510 --> 25:39.900
Your Majesty hid with power

25:40.150 --> 25:41.490
that even Jin Chan failed to notice,

25:41.510 --> 25:43.050
let alone a disciple like me.

25:43.200 --> 25:43.810
However,

25:44.120 --> 25:45.900
someone in the Dragon Palace

25:45.920 --> 25:47.540
is more powerful than you

25:47.880 --> 25:49.690
and can sense your presence.

25:51.440 --> 25:54.010
I must thank Fairy Yunxiao

25:54.030 --> 25:55.540
for knowing what I had in mind.

25:55.880 --> 25:57.300
Knowing my worth now, huh?

25:58.070 --> 25:59.100
Yes, I know.

26:01.030 --> 26:02.740
If you hadn't appeared that night,

26:03.120 --> 26:05.660
how did you learn of Jin Chan?

26:06.120 --> 26:07.100
Why couldn't I

26:07.270 --> 26:09.610
use his pawn for myself?

26:11.120 --> 26:12.100
Fairy Yunxiao.

26:12.120 --> 26:14.490
Didn't you say you'd work with me?

26:16.800 --> 26:17.810
Did I say that?

26:19.440 --> 26:20.490
You must be mistaken.

26:20.800 --> 26:21.570
Stop right there.

26:21.800 --> 26:23.420
When Lan Ling'e was captured,

26:23.510 --> 26:25.220
she said she saw a mysterious person.

26:25.240 --> 26:26.740
He was not from the Dragon Palace,

26:26.760 --> 26:28.100
nor among the people I brought.

26:28.240 --> 26:30.900
Then he must be from the Westdawn Sect.

26:31.030 --> 26:32.570
So you faked the assassination scare

26:32.590 --> 26:34.130
just to draw him out.

26:34.270 --> 26:36.050
That person is the Lord of Horizon Hall,

26:36.240 --> 26:37.570
named Bian Zhuang.

26:38.120 --> 26:39.130
Once upon a time,

26:39.510 --> 26:41.740
he was Westdawn's face in the South Sea.

26:41.880 --> 26:45.490
Did he inform you of Jin Chan's plot?

26:45.830 --> 26:46.570
But,

26:46.950 --> 26:48.930
from my knowledge of the Westdawn Sect,

26:48.950 --> 26:50.490
they are ruthless and cruel.

26:50.880 --> 26:52.490
What method did you use

26:52.510 --> 26:54.340
to make him obey you?

26:56.630 --> 26:57.570
Well...

26:58.270 --> 26:59.490
That's not difficult.

27:01.150 --> 27:02.810
I really can't.

27:02.830 --> 27:04.610
Moon Elder!

27:04.920 --> 27:06.370
It is no use.

27:06.390 --> 27:08.540
Just help me find my match.

27:08.560 --> 27:10.010
Whatever you want, I will give.

27:10.030 --> 27:11.660
Whatever you ask, I will agree to.

27:11.680 --> 27:13.250
I can't do it.

27:14.800 --> 27:16.490
Are you a pervert?

27:16.510 --> 27:17.130
I...

27:17.440 --> 27:19.810
What is love in this world?

27:21.270 --> 27:22.050
Slightly sour?

27:22.070 --> 27:22.780
Pervert.

27:22.800 --> 27:24.010
Catching him

27:24.030 --> 27:26.660
was thanks to Lan Ling'e delaying you,

27:26.680 --> 27:28.300
leaving Fairy Yunxiao unwatched.

27:28.320 --> 27:31.420
Even if he told you Jin Chan's plot,

27:31.440 --> 27:32.740
so what?

27:32.880 --> 27:34.860
From my years of knowing Jin Chan,

27:34.880 --> 27:35.860
his methods

27:36.030 --> 27:40.050
were never just for assassination.

27:40.120 --> 27:41.860
Great minds think alike.

27:43.270 --> 27:45.490
Keeping him was indeed a threat.

27:45.950 --> 27:46.810
So,

27:47.390 --> 27:49.780
I decided to strike first

27:50.360 --> 27:51.490
and eliminated him.

28:09.270 --> 28:10.900
Why so quiet?

28:22.200 --> 28:23.900
Petty tricks.

28:30.880 --> 28:32.610
Voidcity agreed to go to Blood Sea

28:32.710 --> 28:33.780
and save your clan.

28:36.680 --> 28:38.220
I was defeated by Changgeng.

28:39.590 --> 28:40.450
Originally,

28:41.320 --> 28:43.610
for what you did to Ascendance Sect,

28:43.630 --> 28:45.050
I shouldn't let you off.

28:45.320 --> 28:47.100
But the Grand Mage of Voidcity told me

28:47.320 --> 28:49.850
your clan is controlled by Westdawn,

28:49.950 --> 28:51.380
so you had no choice.

28:51.830 --> 28:54.850
Do you want to be their pawn forever,

28:55.400 --> 28:56.900
or borrow my strength

28:57.830 --> 28:59.330
to save your people?

29:03.200 --> 29:04.930
You picked a fine outfit.

29:05.110 --> 29:05.780
Today

29:06.400 --> 29:08.420
is indeed a good day.

29:08.560 --> 29:09.330
You...

29:20.110 --> 29:22.300
Your Majesty, this move...

29:22.560 --> 29:23.780
It's a dead end.

29:26.400 --> 29:29.260
Brilliant.

29:29.710 --> 29:31.780
Using their own spear
against their shield.

29:32.590 --> 29:33.380
It seems

29:33.830 --> 29:37.180
you hid quite a few good moves.

29:37.830 --> 29:39.020
That's flattering.

29:39.040 --> 29:40.850
Pity you didn't anticipate.

29:40.920 --> 29:41.900
Hiding your moves?

29:42.320 --> 29:45.500
You're good at it, and so am I.

29:46.870 --> 29:49.850
After the Deity-Demon War,
the Dragon Clan split into the four.

29:50.040 --> 29:51.380
Besides me,
the Dragon King of the East Sea,

29:51.440 --> 29:53.570
there are the Northern, Southern,
and Western Seas.

29:53.710 --> 29:55.610
[North Sea Rebels]
They're all hoping

29:55.610 --> 29:56.690
[South Sea Rebels]
I'll step down soon.

29:56.710 --> 29:58.580
Then they'll rebel

29:58.580 --> 30:00.050
[West Sea Rebels]
and march on the East Sea.

30:00.520 --> 30:03.730
I told you, this is the East Sea.

30:03.750 --> 30:05.690
I have the first-move advantage.

30:05.710 --> 30:06.780
Your Majesty.

30:07.400 --> 30:09.380
To keep the Dragon Clan
from pledging to Celestial Court,

30:09.710 --> 30:11.450
you'd rather spark a Four Seas War?

30:11.470 --> 30:13.210
Ao Yi is still young.

30:13.230 --> 30:14.380
He has long seemed unfit.

30:14.400 --> 30:16.780
If he inherits East Sea's line,

30:16.920 --> 30:19.810
the Three Seas won't bow to him.

30:19.870 --> 30:21.810
With a slight push from me,

30:21.870 --> 30:23.730
war will engulf the Four Seas.

30:23.870 --> 30:25.970
Then the Dragon Clan
will be too busy surviving.

30:25.990 --> 30:27.810
How could they pledge?

30:27.990 --> 30:29.300
Don't you fear

30:29.640 --> 30:31.810
this war will ruin the Dragon Clan?

30:33.280 --> 30:35.210
The Dragon Kings of the Three Sea

30:35.230 --> 30:36.730
are no match for me.

30:36.750 --> 30:38.020
Whenever I want,

30:38.040 --> 30:39.970
I can reclaim the Three Seas.

30:40.710 --> 30:42.970
Can Ao Yi do the same?

30:43.640 --> 30:45.140
If he fights,

30:45.350 --> 30:47.500
the wedding can't happen.

30:47.640 --> 30:49.500
If he doesn't,

30:49.640 --> 30:52.020
someone must quell rebels for him.

30:53.110 --> 30:54.900
Inside the Dragon Palace,

30:55.110 --> 30:57.500
only two people have such power.

30:57.520 --> 30:58.570
Besides me,

30:58.750 --> 31:00.730
it's Fairy Yunxiao.

31:02.230 --> 31:05.450
If she goes to quell the armies,

31:05.470 --> 31:07.300
you have no protection.

31:07.640 --> 31:09.730
I can kill you anytime.

31:10.110 --> 31:11.690
You can't make a move.

31:12.470 --> 31:13.810
You've lost

31:14.280 --> 31:15.730
this game.

31:17.710 --> 31:19.260
Why do you laugh?

31:20.990 --> 31:21.900
Your Majesty.

31:23.070 --> 31:26.050
You know him too little.

31:26.590 --> 31:28.050
What do you mean?

31:28.070 --> 31:29.450
By his calculations,

31:29.590 --> 31:31.450
unless his odds are near certain,

31:31.710 --> 31:32.970
he will not make a move.

31:33.110 --> 31:33.810
So,

31:33.830 --> 31:36.090
when you sat down to play,

31:36.320 --> 31:37.540
you should have admitted defeat.

31:42.800 --> 31:43.780
I did it again.

31:50.680 --> 31:51.260
Who's that guy?

31:51.280 --> 31:51.850
Why's he lying here?

31:51.870 --> 31:52.420
No idea.

31:52.800 --> 31:53.540
He's in our way.

31:53.540 --> 31:55.470
♪I don't ask, too lazy to fight♪

31:55.680 --> 31:57.320
♪I dare to live my own way♪

31:57.320 --> 31:58.090
Here you are.

31:59.470 --> 32:00.540
Got tired of waiting.

32:02.080 --> 32:03.750
♪The stars smile at fireflies♪

32:03.750 --> 32:04.690
One man

32:04.870 --> 32:06.730
to stop the rebel army?

32:06.750 --> 32:08.930
Don't look down on the Dragon Clan.

32:08.950 --> 32:10.850
Even if Zhao Gongming's power is great,

32:10.920 --> 32:13.420
he can't quell three armies in one day.

32:13.920 --> 32:14.810
Once fighting starts,

32:15.040 --> 32:17.900
it'll be a war between the Seizing Sect
and the Dragon Clan.

32:17.920 --> 32:18.850
Aren't you afraid...

32:20.520 --> 32:22.090
Why do you laugh again?

32:22.090 --> 32:23.760
♪Let the answer be empty♪

32:23.830 --> 32:25.620
Who says he came to fight?

32:26.800 --> 32:27.930
What are you doing?

32:28.360 --> 32:30.500
♪I drink the breeze that comes my way♪

32:30.500 --> 32:32.340
♪The steadiest surge of all♪

32:32.730 --> 32:35.010
♪I grasp the vast firmament♪

32:35.200 --> 32:37.300
I am Grandlord of Ascendance Sect.

32:37.560 --> 32:38.850
How dare you

32:39.590 --> 32:40.900
wound me so badly?

32:42.070 --> 32:42.850
You guys...

32:43.200 --> 32:45.330
How dare you ambush me?

32:45.400 --> 32:46.260
The Elucidating Sect

32:46.280 --> 32:48.420
has Twelve Aureate Immortals.

32:48.560 --> 32:49.780
North Sea Dragon Clan, right?

32:50.200 --> 32:52.300
You gang up on a Seizing Sect disciple.

32:52.320 --> 32:53.450
I'll inform my Saint

32:53.470 --> 32:54.930
to see how to handle this.

32:55.350 --> 32:56.500
I'll inform

32:57.470 --> 32:59.260
Human Sect's Grandlord.

32:59.830 --> 33:02.020
Your South Sea Dragon Clan

33:03.350 --> 33:04.730
will pay blood for blood.

33:05.040 --> 33:06.690
They'll surely avenge me!

33:07.180 --> 33:09.220
♪In this Primordial World♪

33:09.220 --> 33:10.710
♪Who's out there sword riding♪

33:10.710 --> 33:12.260
Quit scamming people here.

33:12.440 --> 33:13.050
Get lost.

33:14.030 --> 33:16.150
♪Snarling and grinning,
playing lone hero♪

33:16.150 --> 33:18.400
♪I toss aside my cup;
my hands open wide♪

33:18.470 --> 33:19.260
What's this?

33:19.350 --> 33:20.260
A magic instrument.

33:20.320 --> 33:21.090
Image Recorder.

33:21.520 --> 33:22.210
What's it for?

33:22.800 --> 33:24.020
Recording proof of you stabbing me.

33:26.350 --> 33:27.300
He's down!

33:27.320 --> 33:28.090
Run. Hurry, run.

33:28.520 --> 33:29.090
Go.

33:29.640 --> 33:30.140
Fast.

33:31.200 --> 33:32.570
Blood for blood.

33:32.590 --> 33:33.620
Go, go, go.

33:33.950 --> 33:35.930
Blood for blood.

33:36.400 --> 33:37.210
Go, go, go.

33:37.230 --> 33:38.260
Such strong sword aura.

33:38.920 --> 33:40.500
It didn't touch me, yet I'm hurt.

33:40.500 --> 33:41.940
♪The steadiest surge of all♪

33:42.530 --> 33:44.740
♪I grasp the vast firmament♪

33:45.280 --> 33:47.380
Who exactly are you?

33:47.750 --> 33:49.730
From Celestial Court to Three Sects,

33:49.920 --> 33:52.090
all obeying your commands alone.

33:53.400 --> 33:55.180
I'm just an Ascendance Sect's

33:55.350 --> 33:57.260
human disciple,

33:57.400 --> 33:58.330
named Li Changshou.

34:01.830 --> 34:03.210
Even so,

34:03.640 --> 34:06.210
you only fought me to a draw.

34:06.400 --> 34:07.810
As long as I

34:07.830 --> 34:09.300
stay here and don't go out,

34:09.320 --> 34:10.690
with no parents present,

34:10.710 --> 34:12.380
his wedding won't happen.

34:13.470 --> 34:16.020
Dragon King, talking to the brat,

34:16.200 --> 34:17.780
I suggest you think twice.

34:17.800 --> 34:19.330
I thought very carefully.

34:19.920 --> 34:21.140
Up until now,

34:21.350 --> 34:23.660
you've only countered my moves.

34:23.680 --> 34:26.140
Even if you block every piece,

34:26.160 --> 34:27.970
you still cannot threaten me.

34:28.950 --> 34:29.540
What?

34:29.990 --> 34:31.330
Have you not seen it?

34:33.040 --> 34:34.900
Look closer at this board.

34:39.460 --> 34:44.180
[Steady]

35:04.110 --> 35:05.180
When did you

35:05.640 --> 35:08.330
deploy such a giant army outside?

35:10.920 --> 35:12.140
I'm asking you to let her go.

35:12.520 --> 35:13.090
Okay.

35:14.400 --> 35:15.730
I will.

35:16.160 --> 35:17.380
But I have one condition.

35:17.680 --> 35:18.500
I want to learn

35:18.870 --> 35:20.210
Beans into Soldiers.

35:21.110 --> 35:24.930
East Sea is so great.
We love the East Sea.

35:25.160 --> 35:25.780
Brothers.

35:26.640 --> 35:27.730
The Sea Deity has given an order.

35:27.750 --> 35:29.450
Within three days,

35:29.470 --> 35:31.420
we must plant all these beans.

35:31.520 --> 35:31.930
Okay.

35:31.950 --> 35:32.970
We gotta work harder.

35:35.920 --> 35:36.570
Okay.

35:37.670 --> 35:40.650
♪In days to come, be God or Demon♪

35:41.070 --> 35:43.110
♪Let them all come♪

35:43.300 --> 35:47.220
♪There's a perfect plan for everything♪

35:47.870 --> 35:49.450
You're a thousand-year-old dragon.

35:49.590 --> 35:51.210
I would never dare be careless.

35:52.400 --> 35:53.500
These 100,000 celestial troops

35:53.560 --> 35:55.300
are merely a small part

35:55.320 --> 35:56.690
of the moves I hide.

35:56.800 --> 35:58.540
If you also have hidden moves,

35:59.070 --> 35:59.970
then I'm willing

36:00.110 --> 36:02.300
to offer them for one glimpse.

36:03.640 --> 36:06.180
Your Majesty, he's not bluffing.

36:06.470 --> 36:08.020
I've clashed with him many times.

36:08.710 --> 36:09.930
Even now, I still do not know

36:10.520 --> 36:12.500
how many cards he truly holds.

36:13.280 --> 36:14.180
Please forgive me.

36:14.230 --> 36:16.090
I'll hide less in the future.

36:17.620 --> 36:19.810
♪Who's clamoring behind♪

36:20.180 --> 36:22.310
♪Acting like fierce demons♪

36:22.700 --> 36:26.400
♪I steadily divine the world's fate♪

36:26.400 --> 36:29.450
I ruled the East Sea for 1,000 years,

36:30.320 --> 36:32.850
never meeting a match.

36:34.320 --> 36:35.260
Today,

36:36.040 --> 36:36.850
I was defeated

36:36.870 --> 36:39.660
by a young disciple of the Human Clan.

36:40.200 --> 36:42.540
With Celestial Court aided by you,

36:45.350 --> 36:46.420
it seems

36:47.560 --> 36:50.140
my Dragon Clan's thousand-year fate

36:50.400 --> 36:52.460
♪Rising with golden armor♪

36:54.320 --> 36:57.090
is about to reach its end.

37:02.110 --> 37:02.900
A good game.

37:05.560 --> 37:07.300
The Westdawn Sect's power is eliminated,

37:07.800 --> 37:09.570
and the Great Tribulation
vanished without trace.

37:10.350 --> 37:12.380
The burden Fate placed upon us

37:12.800 --> 37:14.660
can finally be laid down now.

37:15.800 --> 37:16.570
Yeah.

37:16.920 --> 37:18.780
At last, we've come to this point.

37:19.920 --> 37:21.650
Even Dragon King lost to you.

37:22.230 --> 37:24.090
You're truly something.

37:24.150 --> 37:25.090
Not at all.

37:25.110 --> 37:27.050
It's all thanks to your strong support.

37:28.280 --> 37:30.860
Now you don't think I get in the way?

37:31.400 --> 37:32.260
I wouldn't dare.

37:32.440 --> 37:33.900
If you get angry,

37:33.960 --> 37:36.420
that'll be a Great Tribulation upon me.

37:37.440 --> 37:38.490
So,

37:39.150 --> 37:40.610
I am your Great Tribulation?

37:45.320 --> 37:46.090
Li Changshou.

37:46.840 --> 37:48.300
This Great Tribulation...

37:50.070 --> 37:50.980
Do you like it?

37:55.000 --> 37:56.050
So that's how it is?

38:01.150 --> 38:02.170
So that's how it is.

38:08.110 --> 38:09.740
His Majesty, the Dragon King, arrives.

38:10.740 --> 38:16.020
[Happiness]

38:23.000 --> 38:23.820
Father.

38:30.320 --> 38:31.340
Before meeting you,

38:32.190 --> 38:33.260
I always thought

38:33.920 --> 38:35.130
I had to face

38:35.710 --> 38:37.010
the Great Tribulation alone.

38:37.880 --> 38:39.050
No one would believe me,

38:39.840 --> 38:41.130
and no one would help me.

38:43.360 --> 38:43.940
Yes.

38:44.880 --> 38:45.740
Fate,

38:46.360 --> 38:47.260
Great Tribulation,

38:47.630 --> 38:48.490
and prophecy...

38:49.230 --> 38:50.860
It sounds like a dream.

38:53.280 --> 38:54.090
But luckily,

38:55.150 --> 38:56.090
I met you.

38:58.630 --> 38:59.490
Right back at you.

39:03.920 --> 39:07.340
The new couple beams with joy.

39:07.360 --> 39:09.170
A match made in heaven.

39:09.190 --> 39:11.490
Begin the wedding bows.

39:13.280 --> 39:15.820
First bow to Heaven and Earth.

39:16.220 --> 39:20.450
♪At the cloud peak, with sun and moon♪

39:20.740 --> 39:24.750
♪My heart is carved
with all living beings♪

39:25.960 --> 39:27.170
Before I met you,

39:27.400 --> 39:28.460
I never imagined

39:28.880 --> 39:30.610
a young disciple of the Human Clan

39:31.070 --> 39:32.460
could bring me such peace.

39:34.480 --> 39:36.530
As though all my unrest found peace,

39:37.070 --> 39:39.610
and all my troubles faded away.

39:40.120 --> 39:42.510
♪I recall our near misses♪

39:42.510 --> 39:45.570
Second bow to your parent.

39:52.360 --> 39:54.490
Even if only you and I remained

39:55.110 --> 39:56.010
I would still be willing.

39:59.030 --> 39:59.900
Li Changshou.

40:01.910 --> 40:08.450
♪Making me lean down and confirm slowly♪

40:10.160 --> 40:13.110
♪Not knowing what love truly is♪

40:13.110 --> 40:14.990
♪Just as it was at first♪

40:15.320 --> 40:19.110
♪Day after day, with whom to share♪

40:19.390 --> 40:21.270
♪Never once have I set foot there♪

40:21.400 --> 40:22.380
I'll ask you a question.

40:23.230 --> 40:24.570
Answer me truthfully.

40:26.190 --> 40:26.980
Now,

40:27.480 --> 40:29.420
I helped you break all plights.

40:30.320 --> 40:31.130
From now on,

40:31.510 --> 40:33.210
no one will covet the Pregenesis Sword,

40:33.920 --> 40:35.570
and no one can threaten us.

40:36.850 --> 40:38.230
♪At storm's end♪

40:38.230 --> 40:39.300
I say,

40:39.300 --> 40:40.800
♪stars gleam, and clouds drift♪

40:40.800 --> 40:42.090
I want to stay with you,

40:42.920 --> 40:44.300
be by your side from now on.

40:53.280 --> 40:54.260
Would you?

41:32.210 --> 41:37.990
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

41:38.660 --> 41:45.360
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

41:46.890 --> 41:52.940
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

41:53.570 --> 42:00.020
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

42:00.760 --> 42:07.880
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

42:08.260 --> 42:15.160
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

42:15.540 --> 42:22.890
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

42:22.890 --> 42:30.060
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

42:46.200 --> 42:51.370
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

42:52.460 --> 42:59.480
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

43:00.670 --> 43:06.610
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

43:07.310 --> 43:14.390
♪Alas, our story is short♪

43:14.730 --> 43:21.840
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

43:22.160 --> 43:28.640
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

43:29.420 --> 43:36.630
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

43:37.020 --> 43:44.840
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
